ng Xiaoer tries to do to stop him.", "startDate": {"year": 2006, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2006, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 20, "duration": 24, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Sci-Fi"], "tags": [{"name": "Kids", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Full CGI", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 104406, "title": {"romaji": "PiKA PiKA", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "Abstract short film, the first \"lightning doodle\" film by Tochka", "startDate": {"year": 2006, "month": null}, "endDate": {"year": 2006, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 3, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": []}, {"id": 104436, "title": {"romaji": "Futari wa Precure: Splash☆Star - Maji★Doki♥3D Theater", "english": null}, "format": "MOVIE", "description": "A seed of hope descends from the sky, landing atop Flappy's head and sprouting between his ears. Gooyaan is sent after the seed of hope and uses a seed of despair to transform an Uzaina, causing big trouble for the Precure!", "startDate": {"year": 2006, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2006, "month": 7}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 2006, "episodes": 1, "duration": 13, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Fantasy", "Mahou Shoujo"], "tags": [{"name": "Super Power", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Superhero", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Magic", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Female Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Kids", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Female Cast", "rank": 73, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Henshin", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Primarily Child Cast", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Fairy", "rank": 60, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Urban", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "